Hark!
I come bearing ill news, fisherman.
My brother is coming to steal this land from you.
He knows it has the best fish, and he wishes it all for himself.
+ [A talking fish?] -> Fish
+ [But this is my family home!] -> Family
+ [This is the last thing I need! UGH!] -> Ugh

===Fish===
Is this really the most important thing right now?
Yes, we are both talking fish-people. Get used to it.
There are bigger things for you to be worried about right now.
-> Fin

===Family===
Then you must be prepared to defend it.
-> Fin

===Ugh===
Ugh, indeed. My brother is also quite hideous.
I, too, hate his guts.
-> Fin

===Fin===
My brother will arrive in three days time and challenge you to a duel.
Sharpen your skills, fisherman. Do not let him win.
-> END